// The design of @swmansion/exact-bottom-sheet: the token its BottomSheet's
// `surface` param defaults to. The card is the platform's background, as an
// iOS sheet's is, so it follows light and dark mode. An app sets it by full
// name (`exact-bottom-sheet.surface`) or sets the param (`BottomSheet.surface`)
// in its own design.
tamber exact-bottom-sheet

theme
  exact-bottom-sheet.surface = -exact-background
